source_ref identifies the permitted source using exactly facts:<fact ref> for supplied_input or setup:<operation> for setup_output. <fact ref> is the complete inventory.facts[].ref including its namespace prefix: the fact ref state:loans is written facts:state:loans, never facts:loans. source_ref is not a stimulus path or a guessed field name. For keyed-map records, the accepted shorthand facts:<fact ref>:<record key>:<field> (or the dot-field form) is resolved only against supplied keys and fields.
